1
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,490
How dare you lie to me again?

2
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:27,980
If you kill me now,

3
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,410
your mystical flower

4
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,020
will die with me.

5
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:12,220
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

6
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:20,220
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

7
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:25,500
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

8
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:36,740
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

9
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:43,860
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

10
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:51,740
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

11
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:59,780
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

12
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:07,900
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

13
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,460
[Blossom in Darkness]

14
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:16,460
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

15
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:19,460
[Episode 3]

16
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,930
It seems I'll have to

17
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,580
rip out your tongue

18
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,730
and cripple your limbs

19
00:02:32,510 --> 00:02:33,890
to make you behave.

20
00:02:34,950 --> 00:02:36,770
After all, keeping you alive is all I need.

21
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:40,100
It's too late for that now.

22
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:42,330
You'll only make Yuwen Hao and the others suspicious.

23
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,260
I promise you,

24
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:45,700
what happened today

25
00:02:46,350 --> 00:02:47,650
will never happen again.

26
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:49,450
I won't go to Yuwen Hao again

27
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,650
or reveal who you are.

28
00:02:53,630 --> 00:02:54,300
If I break my word,

29
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,170
do whatever you want to me.

30
00:02:55,170 --> 00:02:56,210
Flay me. Tear me apart.

31
00:02:56,630 --> 00:02:58,060
Yuwen Hao and the others are leaving tomorrow.

32
00:02:58,470 --> 00:02:59,100
Then

33
00:02:59,150 --> 00:03:00,060
you can focus

34
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:00,850
on finding Su Hexiang.

35
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,380
Is this important to you?

36
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,410
It's just...

37
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,450
just something I gave Yuwen Hao on a whim.

38
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:17,820
Why would it matter to me?

39
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,850
It's just a stone.

40
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,540
A pretty little ornament.

41
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:33,900
Do you like it?

42
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:38,380
You can have it, then.

43
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:40,340
I may not be good at much,

44
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,420
but I know when to be reasonable.

45
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,980
I've said all I can.

46
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,130
What more do you want from me?

47
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:01,010
Is that the malice you reclaimed

48
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:01,890
from Youyou?

49
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:05,260
Stay still.

50
00:04:07,250 --> 00:04:08,040
Are you...

51
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:14,820
watering the plant?

52
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,460
Will the flower bloom

53
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,490
once you've reclaimed all your malice?

54
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,200
You said that once it bloomed,

55
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,050
she'd come back.

56
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,700
Did someone ask you

57
00:04:53,700 --> 00:04:54,550
to look after this flower?

58
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:56,170
The flower is her spirit.

59
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:58,340
Once the mystical flower blooms,

60
00:04:58,870 --> 00:04:59,980
she'll come back to life.

61
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:01,850
You...

62
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:03,340
You mean

63
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,300
there's a person growing on my head?

64
00:05:05,770 --> 00:05:06,160
You...

65
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:08,580
Qi Fengyin!

66
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,290
Qi Fengyin!

67
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:11,900
Qi Fengyin!

68
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,020
I said I'd save Master,

69
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,140
but I can't even keep his soul crystal safe.

70
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,900
And now

71
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:32,070
look at the mess I'm in.

72
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,200
That wicked devil...

73
00:05:37,110 --> 00:05:38,620
I'm no match for him.

74
00:05:39,670 --> 00:05:41,180
Hao doesn't believe me either.

75
00:05:42,910 --> 00:05:44,020
What am I supposed to do?

76
00:06:02,550 --> 00:06:03,530
Where are we going,

77
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:05,290
Master?

78
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,700
No!

79
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,850
Yamao.

80
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,260
Yamao.

81
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,530
Yamao, wake up!

82
00:06:44,910 --> 00:06:45,970
Was I trapped in a nightmare?

83
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,650
I can talk again?

84
00:06:50,550 --> 00:06:52,210
If I hadn't been kind enough to wake you,

85
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:53,620
you'd have been scared out of your wits.

86
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,140
I know you're stingy,

87
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,940
so I don't expect to repay you much.

88
00:06:58,400 --> 00:06:58,820
No, I mean,

89
00:06:58,910 --> 00:07:00,530
I don't expect you to repay me much.

90
00:07:00,790 --> 00:07:01,330
How about

91
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,650
letting me take a bite out of you?

92
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:04,020
Maybe one bite

93
00:07:04,230 --> 00:07:05,580
could restore a little of my demonic power.

94
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,820
What's His Lordship doing?

95
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:21,890
He's looking for the wisp of malice Su Hexiang's carrying.

96
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:42,500
Help me.

97
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,510
Help me.

98
00:09:04,070 --> 00:09:05,340
Help me.

99
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:10,740
Help!

100
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,220
Help!

101
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:14,100
Somebody, help!

102
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:30,620
Hao,

103
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,650
a disciple found this

104
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,810
while training here this morning.

105
00:09:34,190 --> 00:09:35,290
Last night's storm

106
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:36,740
must have washed away the soil.

107
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,140
The other jars

108
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,770
must have been exposed the same way.

109
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,140
Shall we open them?

110
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,930
The people inside are still clinging to life.

111
00:09:46,190 --> 00:09:47,170
If you force the jars open,

112
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,050
they'll all end up like this.

113
00:09:52,190 --> 00:09:52,930
Guard the jars for now.

114
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,020
Don't open them.

115
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:56,740
Hao,

116
00:09:57,430 --> 00:09:59,270
I checked with the disciples

117
00:09:59,270 --> 00:09:59,810
of Mount Leiguan.

118
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,050
The people in those jars

119
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:03,100
are Madam Su's inner disciples.

120
00:10:03,590 --> 00:10:04,500
These disciples

121
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,690
don't stay long these days.

122
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:06,980
Every so often,

123
00:10:07,070 --> 00:10:08,290
a group is allowed to leave.

124
00:10:08,590 --> 00:10:09,740
This man

125
00:10:09,830 --> 00:10:10,620
left the sect just recently.

126
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:11,100
Madam!

127
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:11,740
Madam.

128
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:14,930
Madam Su.

129
00:10:20,070 --> 00:10:20,650
Madam Su.

130
00:10:25,970 --> 00:10:26,530
Look.

131
00:10:26,930 --> 00:10:28,650
There's something strange about the people in these jars.

132
00:10:28,950 --> 00:10:29,810
Their bodies are withered,

133
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,380
yet their hair is remarkably thick.

134
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,410
If you'd like,

135
00:10:34,670 --> 00:10:35,620
I could stay

136
00:10:35,710 --> 00:10:36,500
and help investigate.

137
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,650
You...

138
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:38,770
You don't...

139
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,220
- Madam! - Madam!

140
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:52,410
Hao,

141
00:10:52,710 --> 00:10:54,020
what should we do now?

142
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,260
Stay and get to the bottom of it.

143
00:10:57,590 --> 00:10:58,170
Hao,

144
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,530
do you suspect Madam Su?

145
00:11:00,310 --> 00:11:01,460
She's certainly acting strangely.

146
00:11:02,310 --> 00:11:03,340
As a sect leader,

147
00:11:03,830 --> 00:11:05,100
she must have seen it all.

148
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:06,650
Why would a foul smell

149
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,220
make her vomit so violently?

150
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,020
I think you're overthinking it, Hao.

151
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,740
She probably reacted so strongly

152
00:11:11,910 --> 00:11:12,690
because

153
00:11:12,710 --> 00:11:13,740
those inner disciples

154
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,220
were her closest companions

155
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,340
who were always by her side.

156
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:17,570
Hao,

157
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,170
could it be

158
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,690
that Madam Su was putting on an act?

159
00:11:22,310 --> 00:11:24,140
Perhaps her inner disciples

160
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,280
grew jealous of each other

161
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,260
while vying for her favor

162
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,380
and caused all this.

163
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:32,320
I find that new disciple, Fengxian,

164
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,290
very suspicious.

165
00:11:33,490 --> 00:11:34,570
We don't know the full story yet.

166
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:35,890
Don't jump to conclusions.

167
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,930
Split up and investigate.

168
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,930
Report to me once you find any clues.

169
00:11:41,430 --> 00:11:41,930
Yes.

170
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:44,620
[Zixiao Retreat]

171
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:53,290
How can I make her better?

172
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,650
Did I hear that right?

173
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,220
My Lord,

174
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:01,140
are you worried about Yamao?

175
00:12:01,430 --> 00:12:02,340
My flower's wilting.

176
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,890
Probably that awful stench

177
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:10,170
on the hill out back caused it.

178
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,860
Mount Leiguan is a major immortal sect.

179
00:12:13,070 --> 00:12:14,740
How could something so bizarre happen here?

180
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:17,040
But the real reason

181
00:12:17,250 --> 00:12:18,180
she's throwing up so much

182
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:19,340
is that she's so run-down.

183
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:21,140
She's a Moonlit Revival Herb.

184
00:12:21,830 --> 00:12:23,030
She's supposed to sleep by day

185
00:12:23,030 --> 00:12:24,040
and be active at night.

186
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,300
Yet she's been doing

187
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:26,170
the opposite

188
00:12:26,870 --> 00:12:27,890
and has had

189
00:12:27,890 --> 00:12:29,100
one brush with death after another.

190
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:30,690
Of course she can't take it.

191
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,690
How do I help her recover?

192
00:12:36,310 --> 00:12:36,860
Give her medicine?

193
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:39,220
She's a medicinal herb herself.

194
00:12:39,310 --> 00:12:39,980
What medicine would she need?

195
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,650
Go get her a bowl of sugar water from the kitchen.

196
00:12:51,070 --> 00:12:52,460
I mean,

197
00:12:52,670 --> 00:12:54,020
it's better if I stay here.

198
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,690
If she wakes up,

199
00:12:56,260 --> 00:12:57,540
you probably wouldn't know

200
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:59,500
how to care for her, My Lord.

201
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:13,740
Remember the pastries

202
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:14,770
you had yesterday?

203
00:13:15,070 --> 00:13:16,410
If something tastes sweet like that,

204
00:13:16,430 --> 00:13:17,100
it's sugar.

205
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:19,220
Add it to some water and stir.

206
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,020
Mr. Fengxian.

207
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:37,290
Can you make sugar water?

208
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:42,020
Is it for Madam Su?

209
00:13:42,710 --> 00:13:43,140
Yes.

210
00:13:44,070 --> 00:13:45,050
At yesterday's banquet,

211
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:47,380
I saw how powerful you were.

212
00:13:47,950 --> 00:13:48,810
You're no ordinary man.

213
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,380
With your abilities,

214
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,410
you could've accomplished great things

215
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:54,380
among the immortal sects.

216
00:13:55,430 --> 00:13:56,220
Why did you

217
00:13:57,190 --> 00:13:58,020
lower yourself like this?

218
00:13:58,590 --> 00:13:59,460
Can you hurry up?

219
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,020
May I ask, Mr. Fengxian,

220
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:02,570
who trained you?

221
00:14:02,790 --> 00:14:03,890
Why did you follow Madam Su

222
00:14:04,310 --> 00:14:05,140
back to Mount Leiguan

223
00:14:05,590 --> 00:14:06,770
to become her inner disciple?

224
00:14:07,790 --> 00:14:08,410
Are you

225
00:14:10,790 --> 00:14:11,930
in some kind of trouble?

226
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,460
Are you asking about my troubles

227
00:14:16,950 --> 00:14:18,770
or what happened on the hill out back?

228
00:14:27,190 --> 00:14:28,570
It would be best if you

229
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:33,290
spoke frankly.

230
00:14:34,590 --> 00:14:36,140
I had nothing to do with what happened there.

231
00:14:38,910 --> 00:14:39,530
My affairs

232
00:14:40,710 --> 00:14:41,810
are none of your concern either.

233
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,220
Mr. Fengxian,

234
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,220
I suggest you try answering that again.

235
00:15:21,830 --> 00:15:22,650
Something's off about Su Hexiang.

236
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,290
This man doesn't seem to be from an immortal sect either.

237
00:15:25,950 --> 00:15:27,500
And with the sinister discovery today,

238
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,380
Master may well have been right:

239
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,690
there's more to Mount Leiguan's sudden withdrawal

240
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,410
than meets the eye.

241
00:15:41,590 --> 00:15:42,890
Ever since I arrived at Mount Leiguan,

242
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:44,500
the Wanjun Lock

243
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:45,890
seems to have come back to life

244
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:49,020
and is gradually overpowering me.

245
00:16:16,820 --> 00:16:17,530
You're awake.

246
00:16:18,190 --> 00:16:19,290
I've saved your life again.

247
00:16:19,610 --> 00:16:21,350
How many times does that make?

248
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:23,290
Qi...

249
00:16:23,310 --> 00:16:23,890
Don't speak.

250
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,010
Why are you two so alert?

251
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:41,650
Someone from Mount Zhaowu is eavesdropping.

252
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:42,730
What?

253
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,700
Have... Have they found us out?

254
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,060
Did Su Hexiang

255
00:16:47,550 --> 00:16:48,980
try to kill those disciples on the hill?

256
00:16:49,790 --> 00:16:50,490
You should know her

257
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:51,250
better than I do.

258
00:16:53,910 --> 00:16:55,340
She is a sect leader, after all.

259
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:57,650
The other immortal sects often criticize her

260
00:16:57,670 --> 00:16:58,610
for her improper behavior,

261
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:00,580
but at the end of the day, she's devoted

262
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,890
to fighting evil and upholding justice.

263
00:17:03,910 --> 00:17:04,420
Oh, come on.

264
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:05,900
She was so eager to eat you

265
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:06,940
that she pulled out of the array

266
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,660
reinforcing the seal on Mount Qihuang.

267
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:10,330
I don't know

268
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,700
why those people were sealed in jars,

269
00:17:12,590 --> 00:17:14,090
but look at them.

270
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,660
They're all withered,

271
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:17,250
as if their vital energy's been drained.

272
00:17:18,510 --> 00:17:20,620
Maybe those inner disciples

273
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,490
are just

274
00:17:21,550 --> 00:17:22,980
her personal supply of vital energy.

275
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:26,290
Every few years,

276
00:17:26,790 --> 00:17:28,380
a group of inner disciples leaves

277
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:29,980
and never returns.

278
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:31,860
Do... Do you think

279
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:33,380
they never actually left

280
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,140
but were sealed in those jars?

281
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:37,810
It's possible.

282
00:17:38,830 --> 00:17:40,220
This is bound to happen again.

283
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:41,030
We have to find a way

284
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:41,890
to stop her.

285
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:43,170
If they die, they die.

286
00:17:43,170 --> 00:17:44,180
What does it have to do with me?

287
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:46,420
Right.

288
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,220
It has nothing to do with you,

289
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:49,980
but it does involve Su Hexiang.

290
00:17:50,350 --> 00:17:52,010
If she's really been replenishing her vital energy

291
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,700
