318
00:18:54,790 --> 00:18:55,180
All right.

319
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,490
I'll keep watching her.

320
00:18:58,790 --> 00:18:59,290
Wait.

321
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,180
You said

322
