No one leaves.

364
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:15,220
It was you! You killed them all!

365
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,660
It had to be you!

366
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,860
You killed all those people!

367
00:20:20,310 --> 00:20:21,420
Nothing like this had happened

368
00:20:21,830 --> 00:20:23,140
