801
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:22,940
and to stop what she was doing.

802
00:38:26,670 --> 00:38:28,510
If you tell us Su Hexiang's secrets,

803
00:38:29,070 --> 00:38:30,860
we can solve all your problems

804
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:32,650
