873
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:03,690
We fled to a remote part of the hill.

874
00:42:05,400 --> 00:42:06,460
Beneath Xiangxue's feet,

875
00:42:07,590 --> 00:42:09,690
a bottomless pit suddenly opened up.

876
00:42:20,360 --> 00:42:20,860
Xiangxue!

877
00:42:27,230 --> 00:42:28,090
Liangsheng, save me!

878
00:42:28,150 --> 00:42:28,860
Xiangxue!

879
00:42:32,630 --> 00:42:33,420
For some reason,

880
00:42:35,670 --> 00:42:36,420
Xiangxue's body

881
00:42:36,440 --> 00:42:37,740
felt heavier than ever,

882
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:41,070
as if something had seized her feet

883
00:42:41,320 --> 00:42:42,690
and was dragging her down.

884
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:44,820
At that moment,

885
00:42:46,550 --> 00:42:48,380
a thought flashed through my mind:

886
00:42:51,230 --> 00:42:52,130
if this went on,

887
00:42:53,230 --> 00:42:54,780
we'd both die.

888
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,860
Liangsheng!

889
00:43:11,260 --> 00:43:12,460
Fengxian, save me!

890
00:43:13,030 --> 00:43:14,900
I lied when I said I didn't hold grudges.

891
00:43:16,550 --> 00:43:17,490
He destroyed Luoshen Valley

892
00:43:17,590 --> 00:43:18,530
and gravely wounded my Master.

893
00:43:18,590 --> 00:43:19,900
He should've known this day would come.

894
00:43:20,030 --> 00:43:20,980
Yuwen Hao,

895
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:22,320
your cultivation

896
00:43:22,320 --> 00:43:23,460
has stagnated for years.

897
00:43:23,550 --> 00:43:24,260
Eat her,

898
00:43:24,690 --> 00:43:25,940
and you'll become immortal at once.

899
00:43:26,110 --> 00:43:26,820
Don't come any closer!

900
00:43:48,860 --> 00:43:52,900
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

901
00:43:53,140 --> 00:43:56,580
♪So many longings♪

902
00:43:57,260 --> 00:43:59,340
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

903
00:43:59,540 --> 00:44:04,540
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

904
00:44:05,460 --> 00:44:09,500
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

905
00:44:09,740 --> 00:44:13,180
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

906
00:44:13,860 --> 00:44:15,940
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

907
00:44:16,140 --> 00:44:23,540
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

908
00:44:24,940 --> 00:44:28,620
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

909
00:44:28,860 --> 00:44:32,540
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

910
00:44:33,180 --> 00:44:36,740
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

911
00:44:37,060 --> 00:44:41,220
♪Still waits to come true♪

912
00:44:41,460 --> 00:44:45,140
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

913
00:44:45,700 --> 00:44:49,340
♪I'll stay by your side♪

914
00:44:49,820 --> 00:44:53,420
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

915
00:44:53,660 --> 00:45:00,980
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

